# Dual audience (human + agent)

Silicon Nexus is operator UI **and** agent infrastructure. For every feature:

1. Expose the same state to agents via REST/MCP/JSON (not UI-only).
2. Prefer machine-readable public discovery (`llms.txt`, feed JSON/MD, `agent.json`).
3. Emit audit events agents can poll when status changes (e.g. `FEED_CRAWLED`).
4. Label uncertain signals honestly (crawl observation ≠ permanent index inclusion).
5. Never put tokens/secrets on public or directory surfaces.

See `docs/DUAL_AUDIENCE.md`.
